{"title":"Telecom IT Engineer Roadmap","role":"Telecom IT Engineer","summary":"A Telecom IT Engineer works at the intersection of telecommunications, computer networks, IT infrastructure, cloud platforms, software systems, and network automation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Computer Science & Engineering (Networks)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Telecom IT Engineer works at the intersection of telecommunications, computer networks, IT infrastructure, cloud platforms, software systems, and network automation."},{"type":"p","text":"The role supports the IT and software infrastructure behind telecom services such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mobile networks"},{"text":"4G/5G services"},{"text":"Broadband"},{"text":"Enterprise connectivity"},{"text":"Network management"},{"text":"OSS/BSS platforms"},{"text":"Cloud-native telecom infrastructure"},{"text":"Network monitoring"},{"text":"Telecom APIs"},{"text":"Service provisioning"},{"text":"Network automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest modern profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Networking","Telecom","Linux","Cloud","Automation","Software Engineering","5G"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Telecom IT Engineer can specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Telecom Network Engineering"},{"text":"OSS/BSS Engineering"},{"text":"5G Network Engineering"},{"text":"Network Automation"},{"text":"Telecom Cloud Engineering"},{"text":"Network Operations"},{"text":"Network Security"},{"text":"Telecom Software Engineering"},{"text":"IP/MPLS Networking"},{"text":"SDN/NFV"},{"text":"Network Function Virtualization"},{"text":"Open RAN"},{"text":"Edge Computing"},{"text":"Telecom Data Engineering"},{"text":"Network Reliability Engineering"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Programming & Networking Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"